<title>PHILIPPINES: MANILA CENTRAL BANK DROPS 3-MONTH T-BILL RATE.</title>
<headline>MANILA CENTRAL BANK DROPS 3-MONTH T-BILL RATE.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Tuesday it cut the three-month special series treasury bill rate to 13.90 percent from 14.20 percent.</p>
<p>It also offered 78-day special series T-bills at 13.80 percent.</p>
<p>Traders said the rate was lowered to bring it in line with the results of Monday's auction of T-bills which saw rates fall in all maturities.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
